  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Street Children Start Again in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A gift to this project WILL change the life for a young child on the streets of Uganda. Our team work on limited funds as our work is 100% funded by donations only. We work with children of all ages to help bring them off the street and into a community group for change. Offering shelter, accommodation, dance, education, sport and other activities to help these children develop. Our long term aim is to build a creative centre in the community where the children can come, learn and be safe.</narrative>
  </description>
